\section{Introduction}
\label{sec:intro}
Federated learning trains models across decentralized devices. As Section~\ref{sec:intro} outlines, privacy is the core motivation.
\section{Threat Model}
We assume an honest-but-curious server. Recall from Section~\ref{sec:intro} that data never leaves the device.
\section{Evaluation}
The setup of Section~\ref{sec:intro} is simulated with 100 clients.
